  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Not Immortal leads Fang Yuan to Gu Immortal Pang Shan in a small valley on the sixth layer of Crazed Demon Cave. Pang Shan has the most interaction with Chu Du and was the one who recommended Chu Du to the eccentrics. He wakes from sleep, confirms an earlier agreement with Chu Du, and says the help is to lend Immortal Gu and killer moves that resolve alliance agreements.",
      "chapters": [
        1174
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_not_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "char_chu_du",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is dozens of meters tall. He sits in the valley as if the valley were his chair, half lying down.",
      "chapters": [
        1174
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He speaks slowly and with confidence that his method can resolve alliance agreements from any path because his Immortal Gu is called Care. At his will, Immortal Gu Care flies out of his immortal aperture. He and Not Immortal send wills, Immortal Gu, and red date immortal essence with Fang Yuan for Chu Du. Afterward he opens his eyes slightly, shuts them, and falls into deep sleep again.",
      "chapters": [
        1175
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "care-gu-and-sleep",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_care_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan and Chu Du return, Pang Shan wakes from slumber, greets Chu Du, and says he cannot move easily and will not go down to the third last layer with them.",
      "chapters": [
        1188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "second-cave-meeting",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
